  "The paper bends, and the car touches the table.": "f31287adc0986922cbdd.mp3",
  "Jia suggests folding the sheet back and forth like a fan.": "0bc62c533f5b85756d04.mp3",
  "Amir wants to move the books closer, but that would change another part of the test.": "a553048b003fdee25567.mp3",
  "They decide to keep the books in place and change only the paper's shape.": "9d68cc5d0655d8f69211.mp3",
  "This time, the folded bridge holds the car.": "818344ad9f430557d972.mp3",
  "One friend draws both bridges while another writes down the results.": "cd33db598824b4654d48.mp3",
  "Their notes do not prove that every folded bridge is strong.": "f02a615cda617b190d2f.mp3",
  "They do show that this fold helped their bridge in this test.": "e9f2af4bb4bda65a9b9c.mp3",
  "The art club is making a poster for a school book sale.": "9e96577c8382be8fe86c.mp3",
  "All four members want to design the large title at the top.": "ed961ba5287ece42ef30.mp3",
  "After ten minutes, they have four titles but no date, place, or price information.": "6e7627cff337d0b3e6c0.mp3",
  "Nina asks what a visitor needs to know before coming.": "f43a5b5c3d32d3bcd22e.mp3",
  "The group makes a short checklist and divides the remaining jobs.": "a6ec6a8285ecf5b889d1.mp3",
  "One person writes the details, one draws books, and two arrange the page.": "9cd6f5aac78af4228b1b.mp3",
  "They show the finished draft to a student from another class.": "10ad7f33ba15b9b9bfb2.mp3",
  "She can find the date quickly, but the room number is too small.": "d84648c6f257b2f88da9.mp3",
  "The club makes that number larger before printing.": "ca827ff59c48ddbb3350.mp3",
  "A clear purpose helps them work together and make a more useful poster.": "f01b96afe467d54dcb9d.mp3",
