  "One child keeps the beat while the others add their sounds.": "b059afbb2713371a00d6.mp3",
  "Making music together depends on listening and timing as well as making noise.": "61d000383a468328dd7c.mp3",
  "With an adult nearby, Asha holds a ruler flat against the edge of a desk.": "4605d36f988227ed7334.mp3",
